				  "思考区与文件卡清底，文字胶囊与七类工具内容玻璃；代码块随玻璃透明度透出壁纸": "Clear thinking/file backgrounds, glass inline capsules and seven tool-result types; code blocks follow glass opacity",
				  "消息正文（气泡、代码块、思考区）恢复 DSH 原生不透明实色；输入框与对话画布保留玻璃透壁纸；胶囊与思考条的玻璃细调在本挡停用": "Message content (bubbles, code blocks, thinking areas) returns to DSH’s native opaque surfaces; the composer and canvas keep their glass with the wallpaper showing through; capsule and thinking-trigger fine-tuning is suspended in this gear",
				  "侧栏液态玻璃": "Sidebar liquid glass",
				  "dsh-better-sidebar 侧栏毛玻璃适配": "Frosted-glass adaptation for the dsh-better-sidebar sidebar",
				  "dsh-better-sidebar 侧栏（文件 / 终端 / Git 等面板）的毛玻璃适配；关闭则恢复其原生外观": "Frosted-glass adaptation for the dsh-better-sidebar sidebar (Files, Terminal, Git and other panels); turn off to restore its native look",
				  "侧栏全透明": "Sidebar fully transparent",
				  "壁纸下撤掉侧栏的可读性底与色染": "Drop the sidebar's readability base and tint over the wallpaper",
				  "打开：壁纸激活时侧栏的可读性下限、色染与釉光整块撤掉，壁纸原样透出（文字直接压在壁纸上）；模糊仍由侧栏模糊/全局雾化旋钮管。关闭（默认）：保留可读性下限，最坏壁纸下正文仍 ≥4.5:1": "On: while a wallpaper is active the sidebar's readability floor, tint and sheen are removed entirely so the wallpaper shows through (text sits directly on the wallpaper); blur still follows the sidebar-blur / global-frost sliders. Off (default): the readability floor stays, keeping body text at ≥4.5:1 on the worst-case wallpaper",
