				  "实时渲染成功后会自动抓帧缓存这一帧（<key>_gpu.png），它优先于「出图来源」的自动档；切换壁纸途中、以及 live 首帧出来之前，屏幕上显示的就是它。「重新截」会按**当前**画面重抓一张（已存在的缓存会被替换，抓不到则原样保留）；「清除 GPU 帧」删掉缓存、回到「自动」：没有实时画面时是空态（不再**合成**任何「猜」出来的图）；唯一的例外是该帧连**加载都失败**、而壁纸有工程预览图时，退到预览图垫底（作者随包发布的图）。": "Live rendering captures and caches this frame automatically on success (<key>_gpu.png), and it takes priority over the Auto tier in Frame source; it is what you see on screen while switching wallpapers and before the first live frame arrives. Recapture grabs a fresh frame from the **current** view (an existing cache is replaced; if the capture fails, the old one is kept as is); Clear GPU frame deletes the cache and returns to Auto: with no live frame the slot stays empty (no more **synthesizing** a guessed image). The only exception: if the frame fails even to **load** and the wallpaper has a project preview image, it falls back to that preview (an image shipped by the author).",
